{'symbol': 'AEP', 'date': '2022-07-19 13:37:00', 'title': 'AEP DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON COMMON STOCK', 'text': "COLUMBUS, OHIO , JULY 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF AMERICAN ELECTRIC POWER CO. (NASDAQ: AEP) TODAY DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF 78 CENTS A SHARE ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE SEPT."}